// Permit SellShares only after a fixed cutover date.
//
// New idea: the `datetime("...")` literal and `context.system.now`,
// which carries the request's wall-clock timestamp. Datetimes
// support the full set of comparison operators (==, !=, <, <=, >,
// >=), unlike decimals (see 0010 / decimal_equality).
permit(
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"SellShares",
    resource
)
when {
    context.system.now > datetime("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z")
};
